    "body": "This can be done with the `env_var` module: \r\n\r\n\r\n```toml \r\n[env_var.poetry]\r\nvariable = \"POETRY_ACTIVE\"\r\nformat = \"[$symbol ]($style)\"\r\nstyle = \"blue\"\r\nsymbol = \"P\"\r\n```\r\n( exchanging `symbol` for what you want to have)",
